The Entire Premise is making a maze like you would in a tower defense like sanctum
We give the play the tools to make the longest maze they can to buy as much time as they can
	Ability to build walls
	Ability to dig
		Deeper the dig the longer it takes
	Topographical map
	Manually/automatically destroying crystal
The player is limited by the space of the map and the travel time between locations
The main skill check of the game is being able to route a path that allows the player to both create an effective maze and power up enough in time to win before the crystal becomes to strong to fight
The crystal gets stronger by absorbing certain elements within the game world
	Animals/Plants
		These will give the crystal the ability to spawn enemies
			For example absobing a farm allows it to spawn cows/pigs/chickens				 that act as suicide bombers when the player gets close to the crystal
		Forces the player to decide between murdering and pissing off npcs or letting 		the crystal evolve
	Artifacts within ruins
		Not player artifacts. Effectively extra spawn points for the crystral
		Encourges exploration over pure maze building to prevent faster crystal 			expansion
	Some things might add extra behavoirs to the crystal or change existing ones
		 Changes the rate at which crystal flows or perhaps if it senses a wall it 			forcuses crystal buildup there
		Digging if there is enough vertical buildup
Some elements within the world passively hamper the crystal, besides terrain
	The crystal cannot absorb water in any form, only build over it
	Plants take longer to absorb and animals obviously run
		This makes forest/trees natural barriers(fallen logs would work too) 
		Plants may take longer but when they are fully absorbed the crystal gets a 			small boost as compensation
	Npcs will fight the crystal if it starts attacking their towns
		Maybe 2 small towns and 1 large port per map
		These town will passively lose to the crystal.
The player will have access to weapons/armor/relics to help them directly battle the crystal
	Win condition for the player is being able to fight back and destory all the spawn 	points for the crystal, with the oringal spawn containing a boss to fight
	Other spawn points might have a miniboss 
This means the gameplay is broken down into two main phases
	The Maze phase
		Running around building/collecting
		Strategy focus
		The longer of the two phases
	The Fighting Phase
		Action focus
		The shorter of the two phases	
		
		

	
